      "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2019 gross claims outstanding were $2,734.141m. During 2019 there was a gross prior-year strengthening of $156.605m (an increase in gross claims provisions) as disclosed in the technical provisions movement; however a larger increase in reinsurers' recoveries produced a net release of $34.847m. The movements relate primarily to property catastrophe activity and associated reinsurance recoveries following a series of natural catastrophe events (notably 2017 and 2018 hurricanes, typhoons and California wildfires) and adjustments to reinsurance recoverables.",
